<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Course Assignment</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>You've been assigned to courses</h1>
    <p>Hello {{studentName}},</p>
    <p>{{instructorName}} has assigned you to the following courses on {{appName}}:</p>
    <p><strong>{{courseNames}}</strong></p>
    <p>Open the {{appName}} app to start learning.</p>
    <hr style="margin-top: 32px; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;" />
    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">{{appName}}</p>
</body>
</html>
